/**
 * A custom Error used to return a more nuanced error detailing _why_ one of the eight documented
 * errors in the spec was raised after calling `navigator.credentials.create()` or
 * `navigator.credentials.get()`:
 *
 * - `AbortError`
 * - `ConstraintError`
 * - `InvalidStateError`
 * - `NotAllowedError`
 * - `NotSupportedError`
 * - `SecurityError`
 * - `TypeError`
 * - `UnknownError`
